      "confidence": "★★",
      "effect": "1.29x weighted isolated vs the frozen baseline, non-overlapping; per-case 1.23x at batch 2, 1.30x at batch 32, 1.31x at batch 64 — the win grows with batch",
      "attempts": 4,
