      "effect": "4 of 4 winning rounds in this run were reported as not-improved by the automatic flag, while hand-diff plus re-timing showed 1.01x to 1.27x holding on all three batch cases (2/32/64)",
      "attempts": 4,
      "confirms_blind": 0,
